WEBVTT

00:38:59.958 --> 00:39:01.792
the more people you are going to have

00:39:01.816 --> 00:39:04.720
who have the chance
to compete with each other,

00:39:04.744 --> 00:39:06.910
and raise that over a period of time.

00:39:06.934 --> 00:39:09.355
It's a hell of an investment.

00:39:09.379 --> 00:39:13.654
It will produce more productivity
than it ever will cost,

00:39:13.678 --> 00:39:14.995
if it's done well.

00:39:15.019 --> 00:39:16.408
But what happens is,

00:39:16.432 --> 00:39:20.519
states and localities
think of it as a budget item.

00:39:20.543 --> 00:39:22.099
So they look at expenses.

00:39:22.123 --> 00:39:24.532
And they penny-pinch on the education.

00:39:24.556 --> 00:39:28.214
Because if you're in a rich town,
your kids will get a good education.

00:39:28.238 --> 00:39:29.413
And if you're not --

00:39:29.437 --> 00:39:32.071
And a large percentage
of the population is losing that.